{"id":"9031faf8a1461cc3","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-multiplication-pr.md","title":"fact-multiplication-pr — Multiplication is Primitive Recursive","display":"fact-multiplication-pr — Multiplication is Primitive Recursive","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-multiplication-pr","aliases":["92-fact-multiplication-pr"],"display":"fact-multiplication-pr — Multiplication is Primitive Recursive","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","[[92-fact-addition-pr]]","[[92-df-successor-function]]","[[92-df-zero-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-multiplication-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-multiplication-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-multiplication-pr — Multiplication is Primitive Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ead54d85f5ad67d\" href=\"?note=4ead54d85f5ad67d\" title=\"92-fact-addition-pr\">92-fact-addition-pr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\cdot : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (multiplication)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (successor function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_1\">\\(Z_1\\)</span> (unary zero function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\cdot\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(x\\cdot0=Z_1(x)=0\\land x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\cdot\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(x\\cdot0=Z_1(x)=0\\land x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>乘法是原始递归函数</li>\n<li>定义：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\cdot 0 = Z(x) = 0\">\\(x \\cdot 0 = Z(x) = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>递归步：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\cdot S(y) = x \\cdot y + x\">\\(x \\cdot S(y) = x \\cdot y + x\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x, y, z) = z + x\">\\(h(x, y, z) = z + x\\)</span>（加法是PR）</li>\n<li>基函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>是PR，加法是PR</li>\n<li>原始递归运算保持PR</li>\n<li>因此乘法是PR，在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-addition-pr","status":"resolved","id":"4ead54d85f5ad67d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-addition-pr]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (successor function, see [[92-df-successor-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z_1$ (unary zero function, see [[92-df-zero-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\cdot : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"Z_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\cdot\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(x\\cdot0=Z_1(x)=0\\land x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"x \\cdot 0 = Z(x) = 0","display":false},{"tex":"x \\cdot S(y) = x \\cdot y + x","display":false},{"tex":"h(x, y, z) = z + x","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1238,"backlinks":[{"id":"326ba319ed196f03","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8bff810dd710385a","cc110e19a2eae4ea","4ead54d85f5ad67d","fadfd5a594e57bef","69750ae210519a25"]}